{"2671980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conductor Cat", "steam_appid": 2671980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cat Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conductor Cat is a narrative-driven adventure game about rebuilding a broken world. <strong>Gather scrap</strong>, <strong>build machines</strong>, and <strong>restore a dying canyon</strong> as Griffin the cat. He's journeying home aboard his train, racing to see his father one last time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is broken. It needs some ingenuity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Griffin, an agile cat who can dive and scurry up walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for scrap and bring it to your storage car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've collected enough scrap, summon your drone to begin building<strong> bridges, elevators, fans, slide rails,</strong> and more to help rebuild and reconnect the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your speedy train to transport passengers and travel large distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Griffin ran away from home as a child and was raised under the supervision of a conductor named Mr. Marco. Twenty years later, he now lives in the town of Matador. He carries deep wounds from his father and has lived a life full of mistakes and regrets. He spends his days devoid of true fulfillment, in a world that has fallen apart around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One day, he receives a letter from his mother. His father is sick and will likely pass away soon.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Griffin is conflicted... <i>should</i> he go home? The railroads aren't what they used to be... and the journey will be long. Ultimately, he decides to embark on a perilous adventure back to his home country. He will have to use every skill and tool available to him to make it back in time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter will test his character as he reflects upon his life and his past choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friends and reunite with old ones. Build relationships and <strong>make minor decisions that affect some levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Will you make it home in time? What will you say? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More importantly...</strong> <strong>can Griffin change and grow past his struggles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cat Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conductor Cat is a narrative-driven adventure game about rebuilding a broken world. <strong>Gather scrap</strong>, <strong>build machines</strong>, and <strong>restore a dying canyon</strong> as Griffin the cat. He's journeying home aboard his train, racing to see his father one last time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is broken. It needs some ingenuity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Griffin, an agile cat who can dive and scurry up walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for scrap and bring it to your storage car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've collected enough scrap, summon your drone to begin building<strong> bridges, elevators, fans, slide rails,</strong> and more to help rebuild and reconnect the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.poster.avif?t=1785911894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.webm?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.mp4?t=1785911894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your speedy train to transport passengers and travel large distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam